title: No Confidence
subtitle: The opposition demands the dismissal of our cabinet; one answer before the vote.
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishGovernment.noConfidenceAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.no_confidence (Z — 1.27, decision 4A of 22 XI 2026 and the user's note: withdrawing a reform also cuts its
// spending, one option): when the clubs against a cabinet with PPS ministers outnumber those that stand by it, the opposition moves
// a motion of no confidence (art. 58 of the March constitution); the Sejm votes at the next settlement. An urgent card of the
// Government deck; the answer costs no month.
PolishGovernment.noConfidenceView(Q);
!}

= A motion of no confidence

[+ pl_nc_intro +]

- @withdraw
- @court
- @vote

@withdraw
title: Withdraw from one of our reforms
subtitle: [+ pl_nc_withdraw_line +]
choose-if: {! return PolishGovernment.noConfidenceStatus(Q, 'withdraw').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_nc_withdraw_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishGovernment.noConfidenceChoose(Q, 'withdraw');
!}
go-to: done

@court
title: Seek the support of [+ pl_nc_club +]
subtitle: [+ pl_nc_club_line +]
choose-if: {! return PolishGovernment.noConfidenceStatus(Q, 'court').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_nc_court_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishGovernment.noConfidenceChoose(Q, 'court');
!}
go-to: done

@vote
title: Let them vote
subtitle: Cost: 0 resources. The Sejm votes at the next settlement; if the opposition still outnumbers us, the cabinet falls.
on-arrival: {!
PolishGovernment.noConfidenceChoose(Q, 'vote');
!}
go-to: done

@done
new-page: true

= A motion of no confidence

[+ pl_nc_result +]

- @root: Continue.
